			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730570401,
					"content": "這是那菈的琴，蘭納真一直留著。但它應該唱不出歌來了…上面的弦已經走調了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730570402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭納真"
				},
				{
					"id": 730570402,
					"content": "（一柄古舊的烏德琴，其上有幾處斷裂的痕跡，但看起來被修補和保存得很妥善。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭納真"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7305705,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7305713
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7305713",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7305713,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"蘭納真",
					"派蒙"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730570501,
					"content": "那菈的…嗯，那個叫什麼？蘭納真不需要這個睡覺，所以不知道這個詞…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730570502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭納真"
				},
				{
					"id": 730570502,
					"content": "是「床」，看起來還很新呢…之前有人在這裡睡過嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730570503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730570503,
					"content": "#嘿嘿，蘭納真一直在整理…{F#妳}{M#你}們想要在這裡睡覺，也是可以的喔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭納真"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7305706,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7305714
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
